.SH RASPBERRY PI ALIASES
All
.I ra*
commands use
.I ~/.ssh/id_rsa
and skip host key checking
.RI ( StrictHostKeyChecking=no )
because Pis are frequently reinstalled.
Commands are piped to
.BR bash -i
via stdin to avoid SSH quoting issues and to load .bashrc aliases.
